<title>UK: NWE jet has firmer tone but business thin.</title>
<headline>NWE jet has firmer tone but business thin.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE jet fuel business was thin on Monday but gains in benchmark gas oil futures and slightly firmer cargo premiums gave the market a firmer undertone, traders aid.</p>
<p>Barge differentials were assessed at July IPE +$16/$16.50 with cargoes were around July IPE +$16/17 from around +$15 on Friday.</p>
<p>July IPE gas oil futures last traded down 75 cents up at $162.75 a tonne.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7456</p>
